  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **PJs**: back after 40 archived shows (619 days) [2]\n- **Funk Breakdown**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2012-01-11.schoeps.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 106 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Shady Horns members Ben Casey and Ryan Zoidis joined Soulive on some songs; a Tomorrow Never Knows jam also appears [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2012-01-11.schoeps.flac**: taped by Steve Bazley; transferred by Steve Bazley; source: Schoeps MK22/CMC6 -> Lunatec V3 -> Sound Devices 788 [1]. Also: Transfer went from the 788 to an HP laptop, edited in Wavelab 7 with fades, resampling and dither, then cdwav and Trader's Little Helper [1]",
